  "bodyHash": "lBNvfP8Ij+g=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一個 Serilum 模組。用心製作。眾多適用於 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可配置的額外生物掉落物是一個伺服器端模組，能讓你為任何實體在死亡時添加額外掉落物。初次載入時，它會生成一個設定檔。你可以手動添加物品，或使用遊戲中的指令。任何帶有 NBT 標籤的物品（例如附魔和寫好的書）都支援。模組新增的實體也同樣支援，只需確保在添加包含自訂生物的模組之間，刪除或重新命名設定檔即可。如果設定檔不存在，它會自動生成包含所有可能實體類型的檔案。<br><br>生成的設定檔位於 '<em>./config/configurableextramobdrops/</em>'，名稱為 '<em>mobdropconfig.txt</em>'。掉落機率可透過指令設定，或直接在設定檔中更改。</span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"前置需求\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/customization-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含於 Serilum 的自訂組合包\" width=\"416\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/commands.svg\" alt=\"指令\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/cemd usage</em></span> - 顯示指令的使用方式。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/cemd list</em></span> - 列出所有可用於 <em>addhand</em> 和 <em>cleardrops</em> 的實體名稱。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/cemd reload</em></span> - 重新載入所有對 mobdropconfig 檔案的手動更改。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/cemd addhand &lt;entity-name&gt;</em></span> - 將主手持有的物品新增為指定 &lt;entity-name&gt; 實體的掉落物，掉落機率為 100%。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/cemd addhand &lt;entity-name&gt; &lt;drop-chance&gt;</em></span> - 將主手持有的物品新增為指定 &lt;entity-name&gt; 實體的掉落物，掉落機率介於 0 到 1.0 之間。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/cemd cleardrops &lt;entity-name&gt;</em></span> - 清除指定 &lt;entity-name&gt; 實體的所有額外掉落物。</span><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>所有指令都需要作弊權限。</em></span></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/cemd usage</em> 指令：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"538\"><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/cemd list</em> 指令。顯示所有可用於 <em>/cemd addhand</em> 和 <em>/cemd cleardrops</em> 的實體名稱。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"538\"><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/cemd addhand &lt;entity-name&gt;</em> 指令。將生成豬蛋物品新增為豬的掉落物，機率為 100%：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"181\"><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/cemd addhand &lt;entity-name&gt; &lt;drop-chance&gt;</em> 指令。將生成豬蛋物品新增為豬的掉落物，機率為 50%：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"184\"></span><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/cemd cleardrops &lt;entity-name&gt;</em> 指令。清除先前設定的蛋。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/e.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"157\"><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/cemd reload</em> 指令。在對 mobdropconfig 檔案進行手動更改後更新掉落物。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/f.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"166\"><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>範例：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">將牛奶桶新增為牛的死亡掉落物範例。使用 <em>/cemd addhand</em> 指令：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/g.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"538\"><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在牛身上測試：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/h.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"538\"><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">哇！一個牛奶桶！</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/i.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"538\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p>位於 '<em>./config/configurableextramobdrops/mobdropconfig.txt</em>'。<br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>原版實體：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/j.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"581\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>以及例如來自 Animalium 的模組實體：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/k.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"357\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>一個設定範例，其中殭屍村民會以 50% 的機率掉落一本寫好的書：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/l.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1265\" height=\"303\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>結果：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/configurable-extra-mob-drops/m.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"538\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>你可以在任何模組包中自由使用此模組，只要下載仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模組的概覽和更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">留言已關閉，因為我無法在眾多獨立模組頁面中追蹤它們。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 倉庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
